{"about_the_game":"<i>&quot;To find yourself in a new, unknown world - it's like standing face-to-face with a monster. And so many forget: to that world, they are just as much of a monster.&quot;</i><br><br>During the New Year's Eve, the curator of a mansion built on the outskirts of a town invites his protege and her friends to celebrate the New Year together. He gives her an unusual gift. The gift that is never meant to be opened. And only a powerful mage such as her can keep it shut. It and what it holds within. At least, that's what the Curator thought...<br><br>D'LIRIUM is an experimental 2D-shooter with the elements of a horror game. The game brings together some mechanics back from 90s classics, such as a search for the keys, non-linear levels and a lot of other things. Moreover, the game contains a lot of experimental tricks, such as random events, non-traditional controls for a shooter game, etc.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bc1a4924580588c08882e875aa5b1228290cad55.jpg","localized_name":"Tester","name":"Tester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670160/bc1a4924580588c08882e875aa5b1228290cad55.jpg"},{"icon":"3370c09b73f922d741b1257a60282e12bda207e6.jpg","localized_name":"Maniac","name":"Maniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670160/3370c09b73f922d741b1257a60282e12bda207e6.jpg"},{"icon":"3b8a75e688e4b8c71a0b64acdd27f7f55f0cadfb.jpg","localized_name":"Botanist","name":"Botanist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670160/3b8a75e688e4b8c71a0b64acdd27f7f55f0cadfb.jpg"},{"icon":"39060d1a1e3f69cf375009c8f1a858f9951722af.jpg","localized_name":"Panic attack!","name":"Panic attack!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/670160/39060d1a1e3f69cf375009c8f1a858f9951722af.jpg"},{"icon":"6ef14e5c02976e08c4f35d9408aad046041ca3b5.jpg","localized_name":"Sorcerer","name":"Sorcerer","path":"https://cd